Execute SYS:System/Network/AROSTCP/S/startnet
Wait 4
C:netstat -m >SYS:out/mbuf-before.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7500 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve0.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7501 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve1.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7502 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve2.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7503 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve3.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7504 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve4.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7505 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve5.log
Run >NIL: C:tcpserve 4 7506 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve6.log
C:tcpserve 4 7507 recv 0 >SYS:out/serve7.log
Wait 5
C:netstat -m >SYS:out/mbuf-after.log
